# onnxruntime-node, installed by @nanomind/daemon and hackmyagent, downloads
# the CUDA execution provider from NuGet in its install script on linux/x64.
# Neither tool nor this repository's code asks for that provider, and the
# CPU binaries are in the npm package. npm hands this key to install scripts as
# npm_config_onnxruntime_node_install, which the install script reads to skip
# the download. npm 11.19.0 warns that a key it does not know will stop
# working in its next major version; src/__tests__/npmrc.test.ts fails when
# this one stops reaching the scripts npm runs.
onnxruntime-node-install=skip
